{% doc %}
  Collection page results (TE-6 AC1, AC2 partial region, ES1-T103 D3). Reads the
  global `collection`. columns_mobile columns below 48rem; from 48rem
  columns_desktop, at most 3; from 80rem columns_desktop.

  Partial collection-products (name must match assets/collection-filters.js, BE
  ES1-T110) wraps the whole paginate of 24: result count, grid, pagination and
  empty message. `data-results-label` on the root inside the partial holds the
  translated result count for the live region.

  Variant items (multi-source collections, TE-3 AC8): same rule as
  blocks/featured-collection.liquid. An item with a parent `product` is a
  variant, and the card gets the parent product plus `variant: item`.

  Card images: all lazy when the collection has a banner image (the banner is
  the LCP element); otherwise the first columns_desktop cards are eager.

  Cards need no JavaScript: swatches are indicators (TE-3 AC2, ADR 0010).

  Toolbar (TE-6 AC3, AC4, ES1-T103 D5, D6), outside the results partial:
  - collection-filter-open opens the dialog of blocks/collection-filters.liquid
    with popovertarget, hidden when the collection has no filters. Partial
    collection-filter-count sits inside it: a badge with the number of filters
    applied and the same number as text for screen readers. Filters applied =
    all active_values + 1 when price_range has a min or a max.
  - Sort select with form="collection-filter-form", so sort and filters submit
    together. Selected: collection.sort_by, then collection.default_sort_by. No
    sort setting (ES1-T103 D5, ES1-T106 #1). Its Apply button is in noscript.
  - collection-status: live region, empty until JavaScript fills it.

  Empty result (paginate.items is 0): a message for shoppers, also outside the
  editor, because this is the page result and not a block missing its
  configuration. With filters applied the message says nothing matches and links
  to collection.url instead of all products. No collection (block used outside
  the collection template): a hint in the theme editor, nothing on the storefront.

  Test hooks: collection-products (root), collection-toolbar,
  collection-filter-open, collection-filter-count, collection-sort,
  collection-sort-apply, collection-status, collection-results, collection-count,
  collection-grid, collection-product, collection-empty, collection-empty-cta,
  collection-empty-clear, and the hooks of snippets/pagination.liquid. JS hook:
  data-results-label.

  Self-contained: callers must leave the body empty.

  @example
  {% block 'container', id: 'collection-main' %}
    <collection-filters class="collection-layout">
      {% block 'collection-filters' %}{% endblock %}
      {% block 'collection-products' %}{% endblock %}
    </collection-filters>
  {% endblock %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- if collection == blank -%}
  {%- if request.design_mode -%}
    <div class="collection-products__hint" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
      {{ 'blocks.collection_products.placeholder' | t }}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- liquid
    # Select settings are strings; forloop.index needs a number to compare
    assign columns_desktop = block.settings.columns_desktop | plus: 0
    assign columns_mobile = block.settings.columns_mobile | plus: 0
    assign columns_tablet = columns_desktop | at_most: 3

    assign image_sizes = '(min-width: 80rem) calc(' | append: settings.max_page_width | append: ' / ' | append: columns_desktop | append: '), (min-width: 48rem) calc(100vw / ' | append: columns_tablet | append: '), calc(100vw / ' | append: columns_mobile | append: ')'
    # The filter column takes 3/12 from 64rem, so the grid has 9/12 of the width
    if collection.filters.size > 0
      assign image_sizes = '(min-width: 80rem) calc(' | append: settings.max_page_width | append: ' * 0.75 / ' | append: columns_desktop | append: '), (min-width: 64rem) calc(75vw / ' | append: columns_tablet | append: '), (min-width: 48rem) calc(100vw / ' | append: columns_tablet | append: '), calc(100vw / ' | append: columns_mobile | append: ')'
    endif
    assign pagination_label = 'collections.pagination.label' | t

    # Same rule as Clear all in blocks/collection-filters.liquid
    assign active_filter_count = 0
    for filter in collection.filters
      assign active_filter_count = active_filter_count | plus: filter.active_values.size
      if filter.type == 'price_range'
        if filter.min_value.value != nil or filter.max_value.value != nil
          assign active_filter_count = active_filter_count | plus: 1
        endif
      endif
    endfor

    assign current_sort = collection.sort_by | default: collection.default_sort_by
  -%}

  <div
    class="collection-products"
    style="--columns: {{ columns_desktop }}; --columns-tablet: {{ columns_tablet }}; --columns-mobile: {{ columns_mobile }};"
    data-testid="collection-products"
    {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
  >
    <div class="collection-toolbar" data-testid="collection-toolbar">
      <button
        class="button button--secondary collection-toolbar__filter"
        type="button"
        popovertarget="collection-filter-drawer"
        data-testid="collection-filter-open"
        {% if collection.filters.size == 0 %}
          hidden
        {% endif %}
      >
        <span>{{ 'blocks.collection_products.filter' | t }}</span>
        {% partial 'collection-filter-count' %}
          <span class="collection-toolbar__count">
            {%- if active_filter_count > 0 -%}
              <span class="collection-toolbar__badge" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="collection-filter-count">
                {{- active_filter_count -}}
              </span>
              <span class="visually-hidden">
                {{- 'blocks.collection_products.filters_applied' | t: count: active_filter_count -}}
              </span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </span>
        {% endpartial %}
      </button>

      <div class="collection-toolbar__sort">
        <label for="collection-sort">{{ 'blocks.collection_products.sort_label' | t }}</label>
        <select
          class="collection-toolbar__select"
          id="collection-sort"
          name="sort_by"
          form="collection-filter-form"
          data-testid="collection-sort"
        >
          {%- for option in collection.sort_options -%}
            <option
              value="{{ option.value | escape }}"
              {% if option.value == current_sort %}
                selected
              {% endif %}
            >
              {{- option.name | escape -}}
            </option>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </select>
        <noscript>
          <button
            class="button button--secondary"
            type="submit"
            form="collection-filter-form"
            data-testid="collection-sort-apply"
          >
            {{- 'blocks.collection_products.sort_apply' | t -}}
          </button>
        </noscript>
      </div>

      <div class="visually-hidden" role="status" data-testid="collection-status"></div>
    </div>

    {% partial 'collection-products' %}
      {% paginate collection.products by 24 %}
        {%- assign results_label = 'blocks.collection_products.results_count' | t: count: paginate.items -%}
        <div
          class="collection-products__results"
          data-results-label="{{ results_label | escape }}"
          data-testid="collection-results"
        >
          {%- if paginate.items == 0 -%}
            <div class="collection-products__empty" data-testid="collection-empty">
              {%- if active_filter_count > 0 -%}
                <p class="collection-products__empty-text">{{ 'blocks.collection_products.empty_filtered' | t }}</p>
                <a
                  class="button button--secondary"
                  href="{{ collection.url }}"
                  data-testid="collection-empty-clear"
                >
                  {{- 'blocks.collection_products.empty_clear' | t -}}
                </a>
              {%- else -%}
                <p class="collection-products__empty-text">{{ 'blocks.collection_products.empty' | t }}</p>
                <a
                  class="button button--secondary"
                  href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}"
                  data-testid="collection-empty-cta"
                >
                  {{- 'blocks.collection_products.empty_cta' | t -}}
                </a>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          {%- else -%}
            <p class="collection-products__count" data-testid="collection-count">{{ results_label }}</p>

            <ul class="collection-products__grid" role="list" data-testid="collection-grid">
              {%- for item in collection.products -%}
                {%- liquid
                  assign card_product = item
                  assign card_variant = nil
                  if item.product != blank
                    assign card_product = item.product
                    assign card_variant = item
                  endif

                  assign card_loading = 'lazy'
                  if collection.image == blank and forloop.index <= columns_desktop
                    assign card_loading = 'eager'
                  endif
                -%}
                <li class="collection-products__item" data-testid="collection-product">
                  {% render 'product-card',
                    product: card_product,
                    variant: card_variant,
                    sizes: image_sizes,
                    loading: card_loading,
                    heading_level: 'h2'
                  %}
                </li>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </ul>

            {% render 'pagination', paginate: paginate, label: pagination_label %}
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {% endpaginate %}
    {% endpartial %}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:general.collection_products",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "columns_desktop",
      "label": "t:labels.columns_desktop",
      "info": "t:info.collection_columns_desktop",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "2",
          "label": "t:options.columns.two"
        },
        {
          "value": "3",
          "label": "t:options.columns.three"
        },
        {
          "value": "4",
          "label": "t:options.columns.four"
        }
      ],
      "default": "4"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "columns_mobile",
      "label": "t:labels.columns_mobile",
      "info": "t:info.collection_columns_mobile",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "1",
          "label": "t:options.columns.one"
        },
        {
          "value": "2",
          "label": "t:options.columns.two"
        }
      ],
      "default": "2"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
